Backdrop blur in the scene graph: wlr_scene_node_set_backdrop_blur marks a
node, and each buffer under it is drawn over a dual-filter blur of what is
behind it, clipped to where the buffer is not transparent. Built from the
render pass API alone, so it works on every renderer and goes through the
output colour transform like any other texture. Its state lives in addons,
so the structs bindings mirror keep their layout.

